one/1c6932f2dd29b20a34544450c504a839/2023-04/85_4.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會推介安全滿分食油：「Clearspring」Organic Rapeseed Oil (Unrefined, Cold Pressed)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fc075be48a8d965f72e244e1c93f807/2023-04/86_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會推介安全滿分食油：「Spectrum Culinary」Organic Canola Oil (Expeller pressed)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3010630cb3d19d7de170e527a6eb73cc/2023-04/87_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會推介安全滿分食油：「大昌食品 DCH Brand」優質純正芥花籽油\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/711d8174c860ea446660080f6964783e/2023-04/88_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會推介安全滿分食油：「皇冠牌 Crown」極品花生油\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbb1515a2474b88f3c36ed9425f9ee81/2023-04/89_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會推介安全滿分食油：「Costa d'Oro」Vitapiù 5 Oils (Sunflower, Grapeseed, Corn, Flaxseed, Rice Bran)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98bd46137fb0c55900f94125818aace8/2023-04/90_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會推介安全滿分食油：「駱駝嘜CAMEL BRAND」花生特級食油\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8e87298178770bcbb3327df92a6b119/2023-04/91_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會測試食油 3款食油 完全沒有被驗出污染物\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29dc3c3146ea16b813e220b0d8bfab3b/2023-04/OIL_A01.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/190bba902909e445d65b4cc4ce8b6bd0/2023-04/OIL_A03.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58dbe4531c66efc887cc075015396b12/2023-04/OIL_A05.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15ecd29ac1de074abe46370de52dd07c/2023-04/OIL_A07.png\"/>\n<p>---</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T03:18:48.777908+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1023,"images":27,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}